        },
        {
          "text": "Deeloodae waawutmo Hesekia tiqti guri eér, gwa'ara gari nakaá/. Aarusmo Isaya garmoó Amos iri amoorós káy, guri báy, «AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i kaahi, kuúng gwa'araro a pa/ká, gimáy kángw do'ók qoomeeseek.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.1"
            ]
          }
        }
