            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo AAKOÓ MUNGÚ iri axweés dír Isaya, guri báy, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Tláw Hesekia ku beer, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú baabuúwók Daudi i kaahi, ‹Aníng firoorók aga axaás nee hhirhheeriwók iga ár. Ga/aaweek, aníng slafiingók ngwaa doók oo harqoomoó kureeraá mibaá nee kooán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng kuúng u tuú/ dinkwa nee gixsarihe dír waawutmoó Ashuruwo nee gixsarí ngiri xuúm.› » ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaya guri báy, «Layár amór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ daahh ar kuúng ta aan a tí as kawa tsahh adór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ al'axweesantós ngir boo/eés. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng mahhtidár dír tsa/a/amtoodá' Ahasi aa tleéhh an alií surkuús ar harqoomoó digiruú mibaangw.» Mahhtidá' iri surúk ar harqoomoó digruú mibaangw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Hesekia iwa huunguú/ daa'angwí guri daá' as sluufaay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
